<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NeoBody // The Open-Source Cyborg Movement</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #050507;
        }
        .font-display {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        }
        .cyber-glow {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
        }
        .cyber-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22d3ee 0%, #818cf8 100%);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-200 selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-black antialiased">

    <header class="border-b border-gray-800 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-8 h-8 text-cyan-400"></i>
                <span class="font-display font-black text-xl tracking-wider text-white">NEOBODY<span class="text-cyan-400">.IO</span></span>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400">
                <a href="#manifesto" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Manifesto</a>
                <a href="#divisions" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition">The Divisions</a>
                <a href="#roadmap" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Roadmap</a>
            </nav>
            <div>
                <a href="#join" class="cyber-gradient text-black font-semibold text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded border border-cyan-300 hover:opacity-90 transition font-display uppercase tracking-wider">Deploy System</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-20 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-28 border-b border-gray-900">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#1e293b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-3 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest font-display">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span> Project Live: Phase 0.1
            </span>
            <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-white tracking-tight leading-none mb-6">
                TECHNOLOGY TO CHANGE <br class="hidden sm:inline">
                <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text cyber-gradient">BIOLOGY FOREVER.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-400 text-lg sm:text-xl font-light mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                The human chassis is just a prototype. We are merging 3D printing, microcontrollers, and biohacking to claim complete morphological freedom. The era of passive evolution is over.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
                <a href="#join" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-white text-black font-bold rounded font-display uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-gray-200 transition text-center shadow-lg shadow-white/5">Join The Grid</a>
                <a href="#manifesto" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-gray-900/80 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white font-medium rounded border border-gray-800 transition text-center">Read the Manifesto</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="manifesto" class="py-20 bg-black/30 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <div class="inline-block p-3 bg-gray-900/50 rounded-full border border-gray-800 mb-6">
            <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-8 h-8 text-indigo-400"></i>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-4">The Morphological Principle</h2>
        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-light text-gray-300 italic max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            "Your body belongs to you—not to tradition, norms, or institutional limits. Whether through medical care or cybernetic code, optimizing your physical form is the ultimate expression of bodily autonomy."
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="divisions" class="py-20 border-t border-gray-900 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-black/40">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white uppercase tracking-wide">A Call to the Makers</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4">We don't need multi-billion dollar medical corporations. We need garage engineers, open-source developers, and relentless tinkerers.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-gray-900/30 border border-gray-800 hover:border-cyan-500/50 p-8 rounded-xl transition duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-cyan-500/5 blur-2xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-cyan-500/10 transition"></div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-cyan-500/20 mb-6 text-cyan-400">
                        <i data-lucide="binary"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">The Firmware Guild</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Calling all **Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and Pico** developers. We are writing low-latency real-time control loops to sync brushless motors with human muscle movement (EMG). 
                    </p>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Stack: C++, Python, RTOS</span>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900/30 border border-gray-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 p-8 rounded-xl transition duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-indigo-500/5 blur-2xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-indigo-500/10 transition"></div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-indigo-500/20 mb-6 text-indigo-400">
                        <i data-lucide="layers"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">The Structural Forge</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Calling **3D printing and CAD specialists**. We are engineering parametric, load-bearing exoskeletons utilizing carbon-fiber-infused filaments to create custom biological chassis enhancements.
                    </p>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Focus: PA-CF, PETG, Generative CAD</span>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900/30 border border-gray-800 hover:border-purple-500/50 p-8 rounded-xl transition duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-purple-500/5 blur-2xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-purple-500/10 transition"></div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-purple-500/20 mb-6 text-purple-400">
                        <i data-lucide="terminal"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">The Grinder Network</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Calling **bio-hackers and body-mod operators**. We are mapping the future interface: transdermal skeletal anchors and subdermal sensors that route machine data directly into biological systems.
                    </p>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Scope: Biocompatibility, Implants</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="roadmap" class="py-20 border-t border-gray-900 bg-black/20">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-wide">Project Alpha Roadmap</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-8 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-4 sm:before:left-1/2 before:w-0.5 before:bg-gray-800">
                <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:justify-between group">
                    <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 -translate-x-1.5 border-4 border-black group-hover:scale-125 transition z-10"></div>
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-[45%] pl-12 sm:pl-0 sm:text-right">
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Phase 01 // Current</span>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mt-1">The OpenExo Framework</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">Releasing open-source CAD files and Raspberry Pi control code for the first DIY, active knee-assist hiking framework.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden sm:block w-[45%]"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:justify-between group">
                    <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gray-700 -translate-x-1.5 border-4 border-black group-hover:bg-indigo-400 transition z-10"></div>
                    <div class="hidden sm:block w-[45%]"></div>
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-[45%] pl-12 sm:text-left">
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 group-hover:text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold transition">Phase 02 // Incoming</span>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mt-1">Neurological Interfacing</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">Integrating EMG and muscle-implantable sensors into the code loop to bypass external wearable lag entirely.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:justify-between group">
                    <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gray-700 -translate-x-1.5 border-4 border-black group-hover:bg-purple-400 transition z-10"></div>
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-[45%] pl-12 sm:pl-0 sm:text-right">
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 group-hover:text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold transition">Phase 03 // Horizon</span>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mt-1">Osseointegrated Anchors</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2">Connecting mechanical struts directly to human skeletal anchors, paving the way for true, absolute morphological freedom.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden sm:block w-[45%]"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="join" class="py-24 border-t border-gray-900 bg-gradient-to-t from-cyan-950/20 via-transparent to-transparent">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
            <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Initialize Your Sequence</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-lg mx-auto mb-8 text-sm">
                Enter your terminal communication address. We will broadcast hardware repositories, code updates, and coordination coordinates as they go live.
            </p>
            
            <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto p-2 bg-gray-900/50 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 focus-within:border-cyan-500 transition duration-300">
                <input type="email" placeholder="operator@domain.com" required 
                       class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-transparent text-white placeholder-gray-500 text-sm focus:outline-none rounded">
                <button type="submit" 
                        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-cyan-400 hover:bg-cyan-300 text-black font-bold font-display uppercase text-xs tracking-wider rounded transition shrink-0">
                    Connect Node
                </button>
            </form>
            <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-600 mt-4 uppercase tracking-widest">No spam. Open source updates only. Encryption active.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="border-t border-gray-950 bg-[#020203] py-8 text-center text-xs font-mono text-gray-600">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p>© 2026 NEOBODY Framework. All assets open source under MIT License.</p>
            <p class="text-cyan-500/50">SYSTEM STATUS: OPERATIONAL</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
